{"id":"forecast-02","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-02/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":505.36,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":6.82,"text":"Section 3. You'll hear two students called Josh and Emily discussing an assignment on","words":[["Section",0.0,0.44],["3.",0.44,0.88],["You'll",1.62,2.38],["hear",2.38,2.62],["two",2.62,2.92],["students",2.92,3.42],["called",3.42,3.78],["Josh",3.78,4.2],["and",4.2,4.48],["Emily",4.48,4.8],["discussing",4.8,5.62],["an",5.62,6.02],["assignment",6.02,6.42],["on",6.42,6.82]]},{"start":6.82,"end":13.8,"text":"applying scientific techniques to art. First you have some time to look at questions 21","words":[["applying",6.82,7.22],["scientific",7.22,7.9],["techniques",7.9,8.78],["to",8.78,9.26],["art.",9.26,9.64],["First",10.72,11.36],["you",11.36,11.58],["have",11.58,11.72],["some",11.72,11.88],["time",11.88,12.2],["to",12.2,12.44],["look",12.44,12.56],["at",12.56,12.7],["questions",12.7,13.02],["21",13.02,13.8]]},{"start":13.8,"end":50.86,"text":"to 24 on page 5. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 24.","words":[["to",13.8,14.04],["24",14.04,14.62],["on",14.62,15.4],["page",15.4,15.72],["5.",15.72,16.26],["Now",46.74,47.1],["listen",47.1,47.46],["carefully",47.46,47.96],["and",47.96,48.28],["answer",48.28,48.76],["questions",48.76,49.14],["21",49.14,50.06],["to",50.06,50.32],["24.",50.32,50.86]]},{"start":54.11,"end":55.11,"text":"Hi Emily.","words":[["Hi",54.11,54.79],["Emily.",54.79,55.11]]},{"start":55.73,"end":58.09,"text":"Hi Josh. Are you ready to work on the assignment?","words":[["Hi",55.73,55.97],["Josh.",55.97,56.27],["Are",56.75,56.91],["you",56.91,56.99],["ready",56.99,57.19],["to",57.19,57.33],["work",57.33,57.55],["on",57.55,57.69],["the",57.69,57.79],["assignment?",57.79,58.09]]},{"start":58.09,"end":65.77,"text":"Yeah. Now we need to describe how modern scientific techniques are being used in the field of art history.","words":[["Yeah.",58.09,58.73],["Now",59.47,59.67],["we",59.67,59.95],["need",59.95,60.19],["to",60.19,60.35],["describe",60.35,60.97],["how",60.97,61.41],["modern",61.41,61.79],["scientific",61.79,62.47],["techniques",62.47,63.09],["are",63.09,63.43],["being",63.43,63.61],["used",63.61,64.05],["in",64.05,64.25],["the",64.25,64.37],["field",64.37,64.71],["of",64.71,64.87],["art",64.87,65.15],["history.",65.15,65.77]]},{"start":66.41,"end":72.19,"text":"Right. And Dr Abbott suggested that we choose some famous cases to illustrate the argument.","words":[["Right.",66.41,66.73],["And",67.31,67.63],["Dr",67.63,67.89],["Abbott",67.89,68.27],["suggested",68.27,68.81],["that",68.81,69.51],["we",69.51,69.63],["choose",69.63,69.85],["some",69.85,70.07],["famous",70.07,70.41],["cases",70.41,70.95],["to",70.95,71.21],["illustrate",71.21,71.59],["the",71.59,71.83],["argument.",71.83,72.19]]},{"start":72.57,"end":74.93,"text":"Okay, so what have you found?","words":[["Okay,",72.57,73.09],["so",73.45,73.89],["what",73.89,74.29],["have",74.29,74.37],["you",74.37,74.49],["found?",74.49,74.93]]},{"start":75.57,"end":79.53,"text":"Well, there's a Canadian forensic scientist called Birro.","words":[["Well,",75.57,75.87],["there's",76.17,76.51],["a",76.51,76.65],["Canadian",76.65,77.11],["forensic",77.11,77.73],["scientist",77.73,78.67],["called",78.67,78.97],["Birro.",78.97,79.53]]},{"start":79.75,"end":81.35,"text":"Yes, I think I've heard of him.","words":[["Yes,",79.75,80.23],["I",80.37,80.47],["think",80.47,80.57],["I've",80.57,80.79],["heard",80.79,80.99],["of",80.99,81.17],["him.",81.17,81.35]]},{"start":82.05,"end":83.17,"text":"What do you know about him?","words":[["What",82.05,82.37],["do",82.37,82.49],["you",82.49,82.59],["know",82.59,82.69],["about",82.69,82.93],["him?",82.93,83.17]]},{"start":83.63,"end":86.23,"text":"Well, I'm a big fan of Jackson Pollock.","words":[["Well,",83.63,83.99],["I'm",84.39,84.63],["a",84.63,84.75],["big",84.75,84.93],["fan",84.93,85.23],["of",85.23,85.37],["Jackson",85.37,85.69],["Pollock.",85.69,86.23]]},{"start":86.23,"end":92.23,"text":"Look, the modern American artist, didn't he paint those really huge abstract paintings?","words":[["Look,",86.23,86.29],["the",86.69,86.85],["modern",86.85,87.11],["American",87.11,87.57],["artist,",87.57,88.19],["didn't",88.91,89.29],["he",89.29,89.47],["paint",89.47,89.75],["those",89.75,89.97],["really",89.97,90.41],["huge",90.41,90.91],["abstract",90.91,91.57],["paintings?",91.57,92.23]]},{"start":92.45,"end":93.01,"text":"That's him.","words":[["That's",92.45,92.87],["him.",92.87,93.01]]},{"start":93.57,"end":96.73,"text":"I guess it would be pretty easy to fake one of those paintings.","words":[["I",93.57,93.99],["guess",93.99,94.15],["it",94.15,94.29],["would",94.29,94.41],["be",94.41,94.59],["pretty",94.59,94.83],["easy",94.83,95.17],["to",95.17,95.39],["fake",95.39,95.67],["one",95.67,95.93],["of",95.93,96.05],["those",96.05,96.25],["paintings.",96.25,96.73]]},{"start":96.95,"end":97.91,"text":"No way, Emily.","words":[["No",96.95,97.15],["way,",97.15,97.63],["Emily.",97.75,97.91]]},{"start":98.41,"end":101.67,"text":"I know a lot of people think that even a child could paint one.","words":[["I",98.41,98.57],["know",98.57,98.69],["a",98.69,98.83],["lot",98.83,98.91],["of",98.91,99.03],["people",99.03,99.33],["think",99.33,99.71],["that",99.71,99.89],["even",99.89,100.23],["a",100.23,100.35],["child",100.35,100.87],["could",100.87,101.11],["paint",101.11,101.45],["one.",101.45,101.67]]},{"start":102.21,"end":107.79,"text":"To the untrained eye, they might look simple, but they're incredibly intricate works of","words":[["To",102.21,102.37],["the",102.37,102.49],["untrained",102.49,102.99],["eye,",102.99,103.39],["they",103.43,103.59],["might",103.59,103.81],["look",103.81,104.15],["simple,",104.15,104.69],["but",104.97,105.37],["they're",105.37,105.67],["incredibly",105.67,106.49],["intricate",106.49,107.21],["works",107.21,107.55],["of",107.55,107.79]]},{"start":107.79,"end":108.07,"text":"art.","words":[["art.",107.79,108.07]]},{"start":108.55,"end":112.65,"text":"Well, sorry, but I really can't agree with you.","words":[["Well,",108.55,108.95],["sorry,",109.29,109.87],["but",110.07,110.21],["I",110.21,111.45],["really",111.45,111.71],["can't",111.71,112.07],["agree",112.07,112.23],["with",112.23,112.45],["you.",112.45,112.65]]},{"start":113.31,"end":115.43,"text":"Anyway, what did Bureau find out?","words":[["Anyway,",113.31,113.65],["what",114.11,114.29],["did",114.29,114.51],["Bureau",114.51,114.75],["find",114.75,115.11],["out?",115.11,115.43]]},{"start":115.43,"end":121.07,"text":"Well, Biro worked on a case where a client asked him to prove that a painting she bought","words":[["Well,",115.43,116.05],["Biro",116.43,116.71],["worked",116.71,117.13],["on",117.13,117.29],["a",117.29,117.41],["case",117.41,117.81],["where",117.81,118.09],["a",118.09,118.27],["client",118.27,118.63],["asked",118.63,119.05],["him",119.05,119.23],["to",119.23,119.37],["prove",119.37,119.77],["that",119.77,119.97],["a",119.97,120.09],["painting",120.09,120.41],["she",120.41,120.75],["bought",120.75,121.07]]},{"start":121.07,"end":124.79,"text":"for only $5 was an authentic Jackson Pollock.","words":[["for",121.07,121.27],["only",121.27,121.53],["$5",121.53,122.19],["was",122.19,123.15],["an",123.15,123.29],["authentic",123.29,123.81],["Jackson",123.81,124.31],["Pollock.",124.31,124.79]]},{"start":125.67,"end":126.75,"text":"So was it a fake?","words":[["So",125.67,125.99],["was",125.99,126.23],["it",126.23,126.37],["a",126.37,126.49],["fake?",126.49,126.75]]},{"start":127.21,"end":133.29,"text":"Well, Biro found evidence to show it was a genuine Pollock, but the art world didn't","words":[["Well,",127.21,127.55],["Biro",128.07,128.41],["found",128.41,128.77],["evidence",128.77,129.29],["to",129.29,129.53],["show",129.53,129.79],["it",129.79,129.93],["was",129.93,130.31],["a",130.31,130.51],["genuine",130.51,130.79],["Pollock,",130.79,131.41],["but",131.57,132.05],["the",132.05,132.15],["art",132.15,132.35],["world",132.35,132.65],["didn't",132.65,133.29]]},{"start":133.29,"end":134.25,"text":"accept his findings.","words":[["accept",133.29,133.63],["his",133.63,133.85],["findings.",133.85,134.25]]},{"start":134.85,"end":135.27,"text":"Why?","words":[["Why?",134.85,135.27]]},{"start":135.67,"end":140.91,"text":"Well, one critic said that compared to other Pollocks, the white and yellow lines on","words":[["Well,",135.67,135.93],["one",136.21,136.57],["critic",136.57,136.83],["said",136.83,137.31],["that",137.31,137.53],["compared",137.53,137.97],["to",137.97,138.25],["other",138.25,138.49],["Pollocks,",138.49,138.97],["the",139.31,139.43],["white",139.43,139.75],["and",139.75,139.97],["yellow",139.97,140.27],["lines",140.27,140.73],["on",140.73,140.91]]},{"start":140.91,"end":142.61,"text":"the painting were too straight.","words":[["the",140.91,141.03],["painting",141.03,141.43],["were",141.43,141.77],["too",141.77,142.03],["straight.",142.03,142.61]]},{"start":143.23,"end":147.19,"text":"Come on, Josh. That doesn't seem that convincing.","words":[["Come",143.23,143.83],["on,",143.83,144.17],["Josh.",144.35,144.69],["That",145.41,145.69],["doesn't",145.69,146.01],["seem",146.01,146.31],["that",146.31,146.55],["convincing.",146.55,147.19]]},{"start":147.55,"end":149.29,"text":"No, you're right. It is a bit weak.","words":[["No,",147.55,147.87],["you're",147.93,148.07],["right.",148.07,148.37],["It",148.61,148.73],["is",148.73,148.83],["a",148.83,148.91],["bit",148.91,149.01],["weak.",149.01,149.29]]},{"start":149.85,"end":154.65,"text":"But the strongest argument was that there were no records of previous owners.","words":[["But",149.85,150.13],["the",150.13,150.25],["strongest",150.25,150.57],["argument",150.57,151.11],["was",151.11,151.79],["that",151.79,152.29],["there",152.29,152.57],["were",152.57,152.71],["no",152.71,152.97],["records",152.97,153.49],["of",153.49,153.77],["previous",153.77,154.11],["owners.",154.11,154.65]]},{"start":155.47,"end":162.43,"text":"For the painting to be authentic, you really should be able to trace the painting all the way back to the artist's studio.","words":[["For",155.47,155.67],["the",155.67,155.79],["painting",155.79,156.03],["to",156.03,156.23],["be",156.23,156.31],["authentic,",156.31,156.83],["you",157.27,157.41],["really",157.41,157.75],["should",157.75,158.01],["be",158.01,158.21],["able",158.21,158.59],["to",158.59,158.79],["trace",158.79,159.17],["the",159.17,159.41],["painting",159.41,159.75],["all",159.75,160.13],["the",160.13,160.29],["way",160.29,160.47],["back",160.47,160.81],["to",160.81,160.99],["the",160.99,161.11],["artist's",161.11,161.91],["studio.",161.91,162.43]]},{"start":163.07,"end":167.95,"text":"Well, that's true, I suppose. Did they consult with anyone else?","words":[["Well,",163.07,163.47],["that's",163.83,164.21],["true,",164.21,164.47],["I",164.57,164.67],["suppose.",164.67,165.07],["Did",166.15,166.51],["they",166.51,166.69],["consult",166.69,167.13],["with",167.13,167.37],["anyone",167.37,167.67],["else?",167.67,167.95]]},{"start":167.95,"end":172.25,"text":"The International Foundation for Art Research got involved.","words":[["The",167.95,168.85],["International",168.85,169.43],["Foundation",169.43,170.09],["for",170.09,170.49],["Art",170.49,170.81],["Research",170.81,171.41],["got",171.41,171.81],["involved.",171.81,172.25]]},{"start":172.69,"end":174.09,"text":"And what was their verdict?","words":[["And",172.69,173.09],["what",173.09,173.33],["was",173.33,173.51],["their",173.51,173.73],["verdict?",173.73,174.09]]},{"start":174.59,"end":178.47,"text":"Well, they saw a definite similarity in the painting techniques used.","words":[["Well,",174.59,174.81],["they",174.95,175.17],["saw",175.17,175.47],["a",175.47,175.63],["definite",175.63,176.01],["similarity",176.01,176.75],["in",176.75,177.03],["the",177.03,177.13],["painting",177.13,177.43],["techniques",177.43,178.03],["used.",178.03,178.47]]},{"start":179.39,"end":182.37,"text":"You mean the way Pollock dripped the oils on the canvas?","words":[["You",179.39,179.63],["mean",179.63,179.79],["the",179.79,179.95],["way",179.95,180.09],["Pollock",180.09,180.57],["dripped",180.57,181.09],["the",181.09,181.29],["oils",181.29,181.67],["on",181.67,181.89],["the",181.89,181.99],["canvas?",181.99,182.37]]},{"start":182.71,"end":188.49,"text":"Yeah, and they noted the dirt and paint marks on the back, which all of Pollock's paintings have.","words":[["Yeah,",182.71,182.93],["and",183.57,183.73],["they",183.73,183.87],["noted",183.87,184.19],["the",184.19,184.41],["dirt",184.41,184.69],["and",184.69,184.93],["paint",184.93,185.25],["marks",185.25,185.57],["on",185.57,185.83],["the",185.83,185.97],["back,",185.97,186.39],["which",186.69,186.91],["all",186.91,187.23],["of",187.23,187.33],["Pollock's",187.33,187.73],["paintings",187.73,188.05],["have.",188.05,188.49]]},{"start":189.07,"end":189.99,"text":"Why is that?","words":[["Why",189.07,189.63],["is",189.63,189.75],["that?",189.75,189.99]]},{"start":190.49,"end":194.29,"text":"He used to lie his canvases down on the ground when he painted them.","words":[["He",190.49,190.81],["used",190.81,191.07],["to",191.07,191.25],["lie",191.25,191.57],["his",191.57,191.79],["canvases",191.79,192.21],["down",192.21,192.55],["on",192.55,192.73],["the",192.73,192.85],["ground",192.85,193.27],["when",193.27,193.49],["he",193.49,193.63],["painted",193.63,193.99],["them.",193.99,194.29]]},{"start":194.29,"end":199.73,"text":"But the foundation were worried about the acrylic paint that was used on the painting.","words":[["But",194.29,195.35],["the",195.35,195.49],["foundation",195.49,196.03],["were",196.03,196.35],["worried",196.35,196.81],["about",196.81,197.01],["the",197.01,197.21],["acrylic",197.21,197.67],["paint",197.67,198.23],["that",198.23,198.47],["was",198.47,198.67],["used",198.67,198.95],["on",198.95,199.17],["the",199.17,199.29],["painting.",199.29,199.73]]},{"start":200.03,"end":204.17,"text":"It's quite common now, but it was very unusual back in Pollock's day.","words":[["It's",200.03,200.35],["quite",200.35,200.51],["common",200.51,200.77],["now,",200.77,201.25],["but",201.49,201.83],["it",201.83,201.93],["was",201.93,202.07],["very",202.07,202.49],["unusual",202.49,203.01],["back",203.01,203.31],["in",203.31,203.51],["Pollock's",203.51,203.97],["day.",203.97,204.17]]},{"start":205.03,"end":207.55,"text":"So it was probably painted much later.","words":[["So",205.03,205.35],["it",205.35,205.63],["was",205.63,205.77],["probably",205.77,206.27],["painted",206.27,206.73],["much",206.73,207.03],["later.",207.03,207.55]]},{"start":207.81,"end":208.17,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",207.81,208.17]]},{"start":208.71,"end":212.43,"text":"So whose side are we on in this argument?","words":[["So",208.71,209.27],["whose",209.27,210.11],["side",210.11,210.83],["are",210.83,211.17],["we",211.17,211.31],["on",211.31,211.57],["in",211.57,211.91],["this",211.91,212.07],["argument?",212.07,212.43]]},{"start":213.07,"end":216.51,"text":"When it comes to art, you can see the art critic's point.","words":[["When",213.07,213.27],["it",213.27,213.37],["comes",213.37,213.63],["to",213.63,213.83],["art,",213.83,214.31],["you",214.65,214.75],["can",214.75,214.91],["see",214.91,215.21],["the",215.21,215.39],["art",215.39,215.67],["critic's",215.67,216.11],["point.",216.11,216.51]]},{"start":217.09,"end":222.09,"text":"If their knowledge and expertise tells them that it definitely isn't a Pollock painting,","words":[["If",217.09,217.35],["their",217.35,217.53],["knowledge",217.53,217.91],["and",217.91,218.09],["expertise",218.09,218.61],["tells",218.61,219.09],["them",219.09,219.45],["that",219.45,219.85],["it",219.85,220.11],["definitely",220.11,220.53],["isn't",220.53,221.15],["a",221.15,221.29],["Pollock",221.29,221.57],["painting,",221.57,222.09]]},{"start":222.09,"end":227.65,"text":"shouldn't we believe them? I mean, that is usually how it works in the art world, isn't it?","words":[["shouldn't",222.09,222.99],["we",222.99,223.13],["believe",223.13,223.45],["them?",223.45,223.65],["I",224.25,224.41],["mean,",224.41,224.61],["that",224.91,225.15],["is",225.15,225.37],["usually",225.37,225.73],["how",225.73,225.97],["it",225.97,226.07],["works",226.07,226.33],["in",226.33,226.53],["the",226.53,226.65],["art",226.65,226.81],["world,",226.81,227.11],["isn't",227.21,227.39],["it?",227.39,227.65]]},{"start":228.29,"end":232.79,"text":"Art historians have always judged paintings, but things are changing now.","words":[["Art",228.29,228.53],["historians",228.53,229.11],["have",229.11,229.49],["always",229.49,229.81],["judged",229.81,230.25],["paintings,",230.25,230.89],["but",231.29,231.65],["things",231.65,231.87],["are",231.87,232.05],["changing",232.05,232.37],["now.",232.37,232.79]]},{"start":233.43,"end":239.05,"text":"If we have modern scientific techniques like fingerprint analysis, why not use them?","words":[["If",233.43,233.65],["we",233.65,233.87],["have",233.87,234.17],["modern",234.17,234.47],["scientific",234.47,235.09],["techniques",235.09,235.85],["like",235.85,236.35],["fingerprint",236.35,237.03],["analysis,",237.03,237.91],["why",238.11,238.31],["not",238.31,238.47],["use",238.47,238.77],["them?",238.77,239.05]]},{"start":239.35,"end":242.37,"text":"Mmm, that's true. Well, maybe we need a combination.","words":[["Mmm,",239.35,239.61],["that's",239.75,239.97],["true.",239.97,240.29],["Well,",240.89,241.15],["maybe",241.29,241.59],["we",241.59,241.77],["need",241.77,241.93],["a",241.93,242.01],["combination.",242.01,242.37]]},{"start":243.15,"end":244.13,"text":"I think you're right.","words":[["I",243.15,243.37],["think",243.37,243.55],["you're",243.55,243.85],["right.",243.85,244.13]]},{"start":247.63,"end":249.69,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion,","words":[["Before",247.63,248.15],["you",248.15,248.41],["hear",248.41,248.67],["the",248.67,248.85],["rest",248.85,249.11],["of",249.11,249.25],["the",249.25,249.29],["discussion,",249.29,249.69]]},{"start":249.69,"end":254.87,"text":"you have some time to look at questions 25 to 30 on page 6.","words":[["you",249.69,250.23],["have",250.23,250.49],["some",250.49,250.69],["time",250.69,251.09],["to",251.09,251.31],["look",251.31,251.47],["at",251.47,251.61],["questions",251.61,251.91],["25",251.91,252.81],["to",252.81,253.05],["30",253.05,253.43],["on",253.43,254.11],["page",254.11,254.41],["6.",254.41,254.87]]},{"start":285.31,"end":288.59,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 25 to 30.","words":[["Now",285.31,285.63],["listen",285.63,285.99],["and",285.99,286.25],["answer",286.25,286.63],["questions",286.63,287.05],["25",287.05,287.93],["to",287.93,288.23],["30.",288.23,288.59]]},{"start":291.98,"end":294.22,"text":"So did you find out anything else, Josh?","words":[["So",291.98,292.36],["did",292.36,292.52],["you",292.52,292.68],["find",292.68,293.0],["out",293.0,293.24],["anything",293.24,293.54],["else,",293.54,293.96],["Josh?",294.0,294.22]]},{"start":294.7,"end":298.66,"text":"Well, have you ever heard of a painting called The Battle of Angiari?","words":[["Well,",294.7,294.9],["have",295.12,295.34],["you",295.34,295.52],["ever",295.52,295.72],["heard",295.72,295.94],["of",295.94,296.1],["a",296.1,296.2],["painting",296.2,296.54],["called",296.54,297.04],["The",297.04,297.38],["Battle",297.38,297.72],["of",297.72,297.94],["Angiari?",297.94,298.66]]},{"start":299.16,"end":305.42,"text":"I have, actually. It's The Lost Masterpiece by Leonardo da Vinci, the famous Italian artist.","words":[["I",299.16,299.38],["have,",299.38,299.64],["actually.",299.66,300.04],["It's",300.68,300.86],["The",300.86,301.0],["Lost",301.0,301.28],["Masterpiece",301.28,302.04],["by",302.04,302.46],["Leonardo",302.46,302.96],["da",302.96,303.28],["Vinci,",303.28,303.6],["the",304.1,304.24],["famous",304.24,304.52],["Italian",304.52,304.94],["artist.",304.94,305.42]]},{"start":306.0,"end":306.56,"text":"What about it?","words":[["What",306.0,306.16],["about",306.16,306.36],["it?",306.36,306.56]]},{"start":306.56,"end":313.96,"text":"Well, an Italian art analyst called Cerecchini thinks he knows where it is, and he's using","words":[["Well,",306.56,307.26],["an",307.56,307.72],["Italian",307.72,308.1],["art",308.1,308.54],["analyst",308.54,309.2],["called",309.2,309.76],["Cerecchini",309.76,310.7],["thinks",310.7,311.38],["he",311.38,311.62],["knows",311.62,311.9],["where",311.9,312.24],["it",312.24,312.46],["is,",312.46,312.76],["and",313.06,313.48],["he's",313.48,313.68],["using",313.68,313.96]]},{"start":313.96,"end":316.38,"text":"scientific techniques to help locate it.","words":[["scientific",313.96,314.58],["techniques",314.58,315.22],["to",315.22,315.48],["help",315.48,315.66],["locate",315.66,315.98],["it.",315.98,316.38]]},{"start":316.92,"end":317.32,"text":"How?","words":[["How?",316.92,317.32]]},{"start":317.92,"end":321.5,"text":"Well, art historians knew where the painting was last seen.","words":[["Well,",317.92,318.14],["art",318.16,318.42],["historians",318.42,318.78],["knew",318.78,319.5],["where",319.5,319.82],["the",319.82,319.98],["painting",319.98,320.26],["was",320.26,320.5],["last",320.5,320.96],["seen.",320.96,321.5]]},{"start":322.04,"end":325.12,"text":"That's right, in the Hall of the Five Hundred in Florence.","words":[["That's",322.04,322.4],["right,",322.4,322.64],["in",322.94,323.1],["the",323.1,323.2],["Hall",323.2,323.5],["of",323.5,323.72],["the",323.72,323.86],["Five",323.86,324.08],["Hundred",324.08,324.56],["in",324.56,324.8],["Florence.",324.8,325.12]]},{"start":325.5,"end":325.86,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",325.5,325.86]]},{"start":326.5,"end":332.38,"text":"So, Cerecchini had a theory that the painting was still there, and he set out to prove","words":[["So,",326.5,326.86],["Cerecchini",327.2,327.92],["had",327.92,328.2],["a",328.2,328.34],["theory",328.34,328.82],["that",328.82,329.12],["the",329.12,329.3],["painting",329.3,329.66],["was",329.66,329.92],["still",329.92,330.3],["there,",330.3,330.76],["and",330.98,331.34],["he",331.34,331.42],["set",331.42,331.72],["out",331.72,331.92],["to",331.92,332.08],["prove",332.08,332.38]]},{"start":332.38,"end":332.62,"text":"it.","words":[["it.",332.38,332.62]]},{"start":332.62,"end":338.34,"text":"He used a lot of different technology, like radar and thermographic cameras.","words":[["He",332.62,333.42],["used",333.42,333.66],["a",333.66,333.86],["lot",333.86,334.02],["of",334.02,334.2],["different",334.2,334.54],["technology,",334.54,335.34],["like",335.66,336.06],["radar",336.06,336.54],["and",336.54,337.14],["thermographic",337.14,337.78],["cameras.",337.78,338.34]]},{"start":338.84,"end":347.34,"text":"But initially, he scanned every inch of the hall with a laser in order to make a really accurate 3D model of the building's design.","words":[["But",338.84,339.1],["initially,",339.1,339.48],["he",340.02,340.1],["scanned",340.1,340.56],["every",340.56,341.16],["inch",341.16,341.58],["of",341.58,341.72],["the",341.72,341.84],["hall",341.84,342.12],["with",342.12,342.34],["a",342.34,342.46],["laser",342.46,342.94],["in",342.94,343.5],["order",343.5,343.68],["to",343.68,343.82],["make",343.82,344.0],["a",344.0,344.14],["really",344.14,344.44],["accurate",344.44,345.08],["3D",345.08,345.7],["model",345.7,346.1],["of",346.1,346.28],["the",346.28,346.4],["building's",346.4,346.88],["design.",346.88,347.34]]},{"start":348.04,"end":351.04,"text":"Did he think the painting was hidden in the building somewhere?","words":[["Did",348.04,348.4],["he",348.4,348.62],["think",348.62,348.82],["the",348.82,348.98],["painting",348.98,349.32],["was",349.32,349.68],["hidden",349.68,349.96],["in",349.96,350.2],["the",350.2,350.3],["building",350.3,350.6],["somewhere?",350.6,351.04]]},{"start":351.28,"end":351.78,"text":"Exactly.","words":[["Exactly.",351.28,351.78]]},{"start":352.94,"end":359.78,"text":"Then, to find out what the hall looked like in Leonardo's time, he took pictures of it with a thermographic camera.","words":[["Then,",352.94,353.44],["to",353.72,353.92],["find",353.92,354.22],["out",354.22,354.44],["what",354.44,354.68],["the",354.68,354.88],["hall",354.88,355.08],["looked",355.08,355.34],["like",355.34,355.66],["in",355.66,355.84],["Leonardo's",355.84,356.54],["time,",356.54,356.84],["he",357.2,357.32],["took",357.32,357.5],["pictures",357.5,357.88],["of",357.88,358.12],["it",358.12,358.3],["with",358.3,358.5],["a",358.5,358.62],["thermographic",358.62,359.3],["camera.",359.3,359.78]]},{"start":359.78,"end":362.9,"text":"Couldn't he have used ultrasound to do that?","words":[["Couldn't",359.78,361.02],["he",361.02,361.16],["have",361.16,361.32],["used",361.32,361.62],["ultrasound",361.62,362.14],["to",362.14,362.56],["do",362.56,362.7],["that?",362.7,362.9]]},{"start":363.24,"end":363.8,"text":"Not really.","words":[["Not",363.24,363.36],["really.",363.36,363.8]]},{"start":364.32,"end":369.2,"text":"Different types of building materials produce different amounts of radiation, and you can","words":[["Different",364.32,364.52],["types",364.52,364.86],["of",364.86,365.08],["building",365.08,365.36],["materials",365.36,366.08],["produce",366.08,366.46],["different",366.46,366.94],["amounts",366.94,367.32],["of",367.32,367.56],["radiation,",367.56,368.02],["and",368.02,368.92],["you",368.92,369.04],["can",369.04,369.2]]},{"start":369.2,"end":371.68,"text":"really see those differences in a thermal image.","words":[["really",369.2,369.52],["see",369.52,369.82],["those",369.82,370.04],["differences",370.04,370.52],["in",370.52,370.76],["a",370.76,370.94],["thermal",370.94,371.22],["image.",371.22,371.68]]},{"start":372.48,"end":376.92,"text":"So brick would look different from wood or glass, for example?","words":[["So",372.48,372.78],["brick",372.78,373.4],["would",373.4,373.68],["look",373.68,373.88],["different",373.88,374.36],["from",374.36,374.76],["wood",374.76,375.46],["or",375.46,375.84],["glass,",375.84,376.28],["for",376.42,376.52],["example?",376.52,376.92]]},{"start":377.26,"end":377.5,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",377.26,377.5]]},{"start":378.3,"end":383.64,"text":"Siricini worked out what the building looked like when it was first built, and what renovations","words":[["Siricini",378.3,378.92],["worked",378.92,379.28],["out",379.28,379.64],["what",379.64,379.92],["the",379.92,380.1],["building",380.1,380.3],["looked",380.3,380.58],["like",380.58,380.92],["when",380.92,381.14],["it",381.14,381.26],["was",381.26,381.38],["first",381.38,381.66],["built,",381.66,382.02],["and",382.42,382.74],["what",382.74,382.98],["renovations",382.98,383.64]]},{"start":383.64,"end":385.04,"text":"took place after that.","words":[["took",383.64,383.92],["place",383.92,384.3],["after",384.3,384.74],["that.",384.74,385.04]]},{"start":385.04,"end":393.26,"text":"He found that two large glass windows on the east wall had been removed and filled in by the time","words":[["He",385.04,385.96],["found",385.96,386.44],["that",386.44,386.88],["two",386.88,387.24],["large",387.24,387.82],["glass",387.82,388.2],["windows",388.2,388.92],["on",388.92,389.38],["the",389.38,389.5],["east",389.5,389.9],["wall",389.9,390.36],["had",390.36,390.6],["been",390.6,390.78],["removed",390.78,391.36],["and",391.36,391.68],["filled",391.68,392.04],["in",392.04,392.42],["by",392.42,392.76],["the",392.76,392.9],["time",392.9,393.26]]},{"start":393.26,"end":398.34,"text":"Da Vinci started work on his painting, leaving a space big enough for it.","words":[["Da",393.26,393.4],["Vinci",393.4,393.68],["started",393.68,394.1],["work",394.1,394.52],["on",394.52,394.68],["his",394.68,394.8],["painting,",394.8,395.18],["leaving",395.62,396.06],["a",396.06,396.3],["space",396.3,396.76],["big",396.76,397.34],["enough",397.34,397.62],["for",397.62,398.0],["it.",398.0,398.34]]},{"start":398.88,"end":402.46,"text":"But why hasn't the painting been seen for 400 years?","words":[["But",398.88,399.08],["why",399.08,399.36],["hasn't",399.36,399.84],["the",399.84,400.0],["painting",400.0,400.32],["been",400.32,400.72],["seen",400.72,401.12],["for",401.12,401.42],["400",401.42,401.94],["years?",401.94,402.46]]},{"start":403.52,"end":409.02,"text":"To answer that question, Seracini needed to study that wall even more closely.","words":[["To",403.52,403.6],["answer",403.6,404.0],["that",404.0,404.3],["question,",404.3,404.82],["Seracini",405.3,405.84],["needed",405.84,406.24],["to",406.24,406.48],["study",406.48,406.9],["that",406.9,407.18],["wall",407.18,407.56],["even",407.56,408.06],["more",408.06,408.38],["closely.",408.38,409.02]]},{"start":409.64,"end":411.88,"text":"Did he use the thermographic camera again?","words":[["Did",409.64,409.92],["he",409.92,410.1],["use",410.1,410.36],["the",410.36,410.5],["thermographic",410.5,411.04],["camera",411.04,411.5],["again?",411.5,411.88]]},{"start":411.88,"end":412.32,"text":"No.","words":[["No.",411.88,412.32]]},{"start":412.64,"end":416.04,"text":"This time he used another kind of technology, radar.","words":[["This",412.64,412.94],["time",412.94,413.34],["he",413.34,413.54],["used",413.54,413.84],["another",413.84,414.26],["kind",414.26,414.56],["of",414.56,414.7],["technology,",414.7,415.22],["radar.",415.64,416.04]]},{"start":417.11,"end":418.32,"text":"And what did that show?","words":[["And",417.11,417.42],["what",417.42,417.58],["did",417.58,417.78],["that",417.78,418.0],["show?",418.0,418.32]]},{"start":418.8,"end":424.9,"text":"It showed there were in fact two walls there, an older one and a newer one built in front","words":[["It",418.8,418.94],["showed",418.94,419.4],["there",419.4,419.68],["were",419.68,419.92],["in",419.92,420.08],["fact",420.08,420.42],["two",420.42,421.08],["walls",421.08,421.72],["there,",421.72,422.06],["an",422.32,422.52],["older",422.52,422.82],["one",422.82,423.1],["and",423.1,423.52],["a",423.52,423.72],["newer",423.72,423.9],["one",423.9,424.18],["built",424.18,424.38],["in",424.38,424.6],["front",424.6,424.9]]},{"start":424.9,"end":425.32,"text":"of it.","words":[["of",424.9,425.12],["it.",425.12,425.32]]},{"start":425.86,"end":431.1,"text":"So does Seracini believe that Da Vinci's painting is on the concealed wall?","words":[["So",425.86,426.18],["does",426.18,426.42],["Seracini",426.42,427.04],["believe",427.04,427.56],["that",427.56,427.9],["Da",427.9,428.04],["Vinci's",428.04,428.5],["painting",428.5,428.88],["is",428.88,429.84],["on",429.84,430.08],["the",430.08,430.26],["concealed",430.26,430.68],["wall?",430.68,431.1]]},{"start":431.28,"end":435.58,"text":"Yes, on a stone wall concealed by the newer brick wall.","words":[["Yes,",431.28,431.54],["on",432.08,432.32],["a",432.32,432.44],["stone",432.44,432.9],["wall",432.9,433.38],["concealed",433.38,434.0],["by",434.0,434.44],["the",434.44,434.64],["newer",434.64,434.94],["brick",434.94,435.2],["wall.",435.2,435.58]]},{"start":436.42,"end":439.16,"text":"So what's the next stage in the investigation?","words":[["So",436.42,437.04],["what's",437.04,437.66],["the",437.66,437.78],["next",437.78,437.96],["stage",437.96,438.28],["in",438.28,438.4],["the",438.4,438.5],["investigation?",438.5,439.16]]},{"start":439.16,"end":445.28,"text":"Well, he isn't allowed to remove any plaster or bricks, so he's now experimenting with","words":[["Well,",439.16,439.96],["he",440.1,440.26],["isn't",440.26,440.52],["allowed",440.52,440.84],["to",440.84,441.08],["remove",441.08,441.4],["any",441.4,441.76],["plaster",441.76,442.36],["or",442.36,442.68],["bricks,",442.68,443.12],["so",443.46,443.82],["he's",443.82,444.06],["now",444.06,444.24],["experimenting",444.24,444.88],["with",444.88,445.28]]},{"start":445.28,"end":448.52,"text":"a gamma ray camera to try and verify his theory.","words":[["a",445.28,445.42],["gamma",445.42,445.78],["ray",445.78,446.18],["camera",446.18,446.6],["to",446.6,446.98],["try",446.98,447.2],["and",447.2,447.32],["verify",447.32,447.72],["his",447.72,448.1],["theory.",448.1,448.52]]},{"start":449.12,"end":454.46,"text":"Well, I think we've got some really strong examples there of how science can help art.","words":[["Well,",449.12,449.58],["I",450.02,450.26],["think",450.26,450.46],["we've",450.46,450.72],["got",450.72,450.9],["some",450.9,451.18],["really",451.18,451.56],["strong",451.56,451.96],["examples",451.96,452.62],["there",452.62,452.88],["of",452.88,453.08],["how",453.08,453.28],["science",453.28,453.68],["can",453.68,453.94],["help",453.94,454.14],["art.",454.14,454.46]]},{"start":455.28,"end":457.28,"text":"Let's see if we can type up an outline.","words":[["Let's",455.28,455.72],["see",455.72,455.82],["if",455.82,455.94],["we",455.94,456.06],["can",456.06,456.22],["type",456.22,456.54],["up",456.54,456.86],["an",456.86,457.04],["outline.",457.04,457.28]]},{"start":461.46,"end":463.34,"text":"That is the end of section 3.","words":[["That",461.46,461.84],["is",461.84,461.96],["the",461.96,462.1],["end",462.1,462.44],["of",462.44,462.62],["section",462.62,462.86],["3.",462.86,463.34]]},{"start":464.18,"end":466.76,"text":"You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["You",464.18,464.36],["now",464.36,464.6],["have",464.6,464.92],["half",464.92,465.22],["a",465.22,465.4],["minute",465.4,465.58],["to",465.58,465.86],["check",465.86,466.18],["your",466.18,466.34],["answers.",466.34,466.76]]},{"start":466.76,"end":500.13,"text":"Now turn to section 4 on page 7.","words":[["Now",466.76,467.72],["turn",497.39,497.69],["to",497.69,497.89],["section",497.89,498.13],["4",498.13,498.67],["on",498.67,499.41],["page",499.41,499.71],["7.",499.71,500.13]]}]}